            "title": "<p>Racquet Up Detroit</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>SVS Vision believes in Detroit. Racquet Up Detroit is an out-of-school youth development program that uses the sport of squash – in combination with fitness, academic support, community service, college exposure, summer opportunities, and mentoring – to make a difference in the lives of Detroit youth. Since 2010, we have helped Racquet Up Detroit to enable over 500 students to receive eye exams, protective eyewear, and to support their academic success on and off the court.</p>",
